; Shared COMPACT lowercase, 26 glyphs: LOWER_A..Z (a..z). Drop-in for font_lower.tiles (same label,
; same order: code indexes FONT_MINI_LOWER_LOWER_A + (c - 'a')). Companion of font_mini.tiles:
; PROPORTIONAL, left-aligned, width = last ink column + 1 (i 2 px, l j 3, m w 7).
; - x-height 4 px on rows 3-6, baseline row 6; ascenders (b d f h k l) and the i/j dots start at
;   row 1 = cap height. Descenders (g j p q y) drop into row 7 (bowl on rows 3-5).
; Generated by a scratch script; this file is the source of truth now.

